Package: adblock-dns
Version: 0.1.1
Architecture: all
Maintainer: dimult22@gmail.com
Section: net
Priority: optional
Depends: dnsmasq-full, wget-ssl
Description: Local ad-blocking DNS server for Keenetic (Entware).
 Runs dnsmasq, blocks ad/tracker domains from configurable blocklists
 and forwards everything else to a configurable upstream DNS
 (Google DNS 8.8.8.8/8.8.4.4 by default).
 Listens on 127.0.0.1:553 by default and is meant to be registered in
 the router as a name-server, leaving port 53 to the built-in DNS proxy.
